# cursor_project_rules/README.md

## Purpose
This folder defines the project’s rules, constraints, and workflows that the assistant must follow.

## Contents
- `overview.mdc`: product vision, scope, constraints
- `implementation-plan.mdc`: step-by-step feature workflow
- `architecture.mdc`: system structure, major modules
- `coding-standards.mdc`: style rules, naming, error handling
- `security.mdc`: auth, data handling, privacy rules
- `testing.mdc`: unit/integration test expectations
- `ui-ux.mdc`: design principles, accessibility